id: GUIDE5-2
package: fandhe-workshop-pack
test: guide5_limits
target: crates/pack/src/guidance.rs
find:         let start_levels = chapter_start_levels(scope);
replace:         let start_levels: BTreeSet<GuidanceLevel> = chapter_start_levels(scope).into_iter().chain([GuidanceLevel::B]).collect();
expect-fail: guide5_c_undeclared_chapter_body_is_not_checked
note: 宣言の無い章も水準 B で検査する（限界 (c) の対象外を崩す）
